WEBVTT

00:25.430 --> 00:26.720
Good to see you, everyone!

00:26.720 --> 00:29.430
Don't forget to
click the follow button, all right?

00:30.430 --> 00:31.700
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.350 --> 00:35.430
Hi. Follow us.

00:39.370 --> 00:41.180
Their demand to use Lu Guang for trade

00:41.180 --> 00:42.740
must be a part of Qian Jin's trap

00:43.470 --> 00:45.620
He said the only person
who can go there with you

00:46.450 --> 00:47.240
is

00:48.450 --> 00:49.720
Qiao Ling

00:49.720 --> 00:51.560
OK. I agree.

00:54.470 --> 00:55.930
Wait a minute

00:55.930 --> 00:58.180
There should be another solution

00:58.180 --> 00:59.770
No time for pondering

00:59.770 --> 01:01.410
Shall we discuss on the way

01:07.660 --> 01:08.660
With her ability,

01:08.660 --> 01:11.390
We can monitor your movements in real-time.

01:11.390 --> 01:12.970
Thank you, Xixi.

01:12.970 --> 01:14.220
I've got an idea.

01:15.290 --> 01:17.270
What if the "me" at the trade

01:17.270 --> 01:19.140
is not the current "me"?

01:19.140 --> 01:19.950
What do you mean?

01:22.160 --> 01:25.640
I can enter the photo captured
by the surveillance camera.

01:25.640 --> 01:26.910
The "me" in the photo

01:26.910 --> 01:27.950
will deal with them.

01:30.000 --> 01:31.410
Once the trade is completed

01:31.410 --> 01:33.140
with Lu Guang's safety ensured,

01:33.140 --> 01:34.290
I will clap my hands to leave.

01:35.910 --> 01:37.060
Then,

01:37.060 --> 01:40.040
I can return to the place
in the photo and rejoin you.

01:45.000 --> 01:47.810
This is the real-time footage of
the entrance to the control room.

01:50.580 --> 01:51.770
Your idea

01:51.770 --> 01:53.200
is beyond my understanding.

01:54.160 --> 01:55.330
Seriously, can it work?

01:56.160 --> 01:58.640
Captain Xiao, I did it!

02:00.250 --> 02:02.700
Weren't you here just now?

02:04.080 --> 02:05.720
Nothing will go wrong now.

02:05.720 --> 02:06.540
Let's go.

02:08.370 --> 02:11.290
Many magic shows were
performed in this theater.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.140
Some of them

02:13.140 --> 02:14.990
required mechanisms for
quick ascents and descents.

02:17.080 --> 02:20.310
As long as Cheng Xiaoshi stands
at the designated position,

02:20.310 --> 02:22.310
we can bring him here.

02:23.370 --> 02:24.870
I've dealt with him several times.

02:25.580 --> 02:27.930
He won't be captured with folded arms.

02:27.930 --> 02:30.560
He must have a plan
to escape with his ability.

02:31.200 --> 02:33.180
Sometimes, if one relies
too much on his ability,

02:33.180 --> 02:35.720
he'll drop the guard.

02:38.450 --> 02:39.620
I have a Plan B

02:40.410 --> 02:42.410
Wherever Cheng Xiaoshi runs,

02:43.620 --> 02:45.720
as long as we can locate him

02:49.350 --> 02:52.100
I will hide a tracker in his costume

02:52.100 --> 02:54.520
and then disable the metal detector,

02:54.520 --> 02:56.560
making them believe that
they've passed the security check

02:57.350 --> 02:58.220
Great

02:58.970 --> 03:00.850
We've located him.

03:06.470 --> 03:08.100
Oh, my gosh!

03:08.100 --> 03:09.520
Unbelievable!

03:13.180 --> 03:15.100
Boss, you are right

03:15.100 --> 03:16.390
He did change his location

03:16.390 --> 03:17.560
And he's nearby

03:18.560 --> 03:20.770
As Lu Guang is saved,

03:20.770 --> 03:23.470
the surrounding police force
will definitely rush in.

03:24.020 --> 03:26.180
To delay their action

03:26.180 --> 03:28.970
and eliminate the traces

03:29.600 --> 03:30.850
then,

03:30.850 --> 03:34.430
an explosion accident

03:34.430 --> 03:36.470
should be the best choice.

03:51.350 --> 03:52.430
Hey,

03:52.430 --> 03:53.890
can you see them now

05:59.350 --> 06:01.020
Don't try to stall me off

06:01.020 --> 06:02.140
Hurry

06:10.520 --> 06:12.140
Finally, we get you here.

06:14.680 --> 06:16.180
It wasn't easy.

06:17.810 --> 06:20.600
Boss, you're quite a prophet.

06:21.350 --> 06:24.060
They were hiding nearby indeed.

06:24.060 --> 06:24.890
Well,

06:24.890 --> 06:26.180
I also brought back another person.

06:31.020 --> 06:32.390
Cheng Xiaoshi

06:32.390 --> 06:34.470
You can't play any tricks this time

06:40.680 --> 06:41.600
Why

06:42.770 --> 06:44.430
Why are you here?

06:48.180 --> 06:49.640
Isn't it good?

06:49.640 --> 06:51.560
A grand family reunion

06:53.430 --> 06:54.720
Come over now

07:00.270 --> 07:01.140
I said

07:02.470 --> 07:05.720
I detest betrayal the most.

07:07.720 --> 07:07.720
Wait

07:07.720 --> 07:08.470
No
Wait

07:11.220 --> 07:12.270
Can I

07:12.270 --> 07:13.310
ask a question first

07:15.470 --> 07:16.310
That night,

07:17.350 --> 07:19.310
who came to Lu Guang's ward

07:20.020 --> 07:20.850
and gave him the photo?

07:30.890 --> 07:31.680
Wait

07:38.470 --> 07:40.270
The one I met in the corridor

07:41.060 --> 07:43.310
I gave the phone of that Min to them

07:44.020 --> 07:45.390
Wasn't it you?

07:49.140 --> 07:50.310
What's the matter?

07:50.310 --> 07:52.430
Boss doesn't trust me?

07:54.020 --> 07:57.220
I've got the aftermath covered for you

07:59.470 --> 08:01.220
What? What do you mean by that?

08:05.390 --> 08:06.430
Oh, I see!

08:07.220 --> 08:09.470
Brilliant! Brilliant!

08:12.270 --> 08:13.430
I'm leaving now.

08:15.930 --> 08:17.770
You even picked a blind
spot in the surveillance.

08:19.890 --> 08:20.850
What happened?

08:21.770 --> 08:23.890
You've got Liu Min's phone?

08:25.770 --> 08:27.470
Are you even doubting me?

08:28.520 --> 08:29.310
If it's not you

08:31.020 --> 08:32.310
it must be her

08:35.350 --> 08:36.560
Stop hiding it

08:36.560 --> 08:38.270
You sister wouldn't lie.

08:43.770 --> 08:44.810
I thought about

08:46.310 --> 08:47.640
changing the past

08:49.220 --> 08:50.680
In the end,

08:50.680 --> 08:52.430
even you will also betray me

08:53.100 --> 08:55.100
Give me Liu Min's phone

08:56.140 --> 08:57.220
Wait

08:58.140 --> 09:00.600
I'm a bit confused

09:00.600 --> 09:01.720
Boss

09:01.720 --> 09:04.060
I already told you about the phone.

09:04.060 --> 09:06.520
You didn't ask him for it until now?

09:06.520 --> 09:08.020
He didn't give it to you before.

09:08.020 --> 09:10.680
Doesn't that expose his personal motive?

09:12.640 --> 09:14.520
So you already knew it

09:26.890 --> 09:30.390
- Idiot
- The only reason why I retained you

09:30.390 --> 09:32.140
is that you were obedient.

09:33.060 --> 09:36.350
Now that you've known too much,

09:38.270 --> 09:40.140
it's time to shut your lips

09:44.310 --> 09:45.890
You've already suspected me,

09:47.140 --> 09:50.100
just played ignorant to keep using me.

09:50.640 --> 09:53.390
I guess he never trusted you

09:53.390 --> 09:54.520
Shut up!

09:54.520 --> 09:55.640
I told you

09:55.640 --> 09:59.270
What I detest most is betrayal,
betrayal, betrayal!

09:59.270 --> 10:00.640
Why did you do that?

10:01.560 --> 10:03.680
We were just using each
other from the beginning.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.850
There's no trust.

10:05.930 --> 10:07.220
And no betrayal either.

10:08.270 --> 10:10.890
Didn't I give you my trust?

10:10.890 --> 10:14.810
I raised you and your mute
sister as if you were my children.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.140
Sounds nicer than it is.

10:17.140 --> 10:19.060
You just treat them as tools

10:19.060 --> 10:20.470
and substitutes for emotion needs.

10:21.520 --> 10:22.850
It's not my fault

10:23.600 --> 10:25.810
I don't need any substitutes.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.180
Well

10:30.430 --> 10:32.850
You can go back to the past, right?

10:32.850 --> 10:33.770
Awesome

10:36.350 --> 10:38.140
Then go back there

10:38.140 --> 10:39.180
and fix everything

10:41.020 --> 10:41.810
Then

10:42.600 --> 10:44.930
none of us would have to suffer

11:07.930 --> 11:09.680
It's all because of her

11:10.220 --> 11:12.930
She's the mistake to be fixed

11:19.640 --> 11:20.640
What happened?

11:20.640 --> 11:22.060
The gas pipes exploded?

11:22.060 --> 11:22.970
I don't know

11:22.970 --> 11:24.310
Call the fire department.

11:24.310 --> 11:25.560
Someone has done it.

11:41.180 --> 11:42.570
Gotta call for reinforcements now

11:44.270 --> 11:46.020
Damn it, my phone was taken away

11:48.430 --> 11:49.640
Step aside

11:49.640 --> 11:50.810
Stop crowding around here

11:50.810 --> 11:51.390
It's dangerous!

11:51.390 --> 11:52.310
Who's he?

11:52.310 --> 11:53.180
A police officer?

11:59.680 --> 12:01.140
Qiao Ling, Lu Guang

12:03.140 --> 12:04.310
How are you?

12:04.310 --> 12:05.020
Get hurt?

12:05.020 --> 12:06.270
What's going on inside?

12:08.100 --> 12:11.390
As we approached the entrance,
we heard an explosion from below,

12:11.390 --> 12:13.720
followed by a rush of air.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.020
Once we recovered,

12:15.020 --> 12:16.810
we helped the people

12:16.810 --> 12:17.850
in the hallway get out.

12:17.850 --> 12:18.970
Where is Cheng Xiaoshi?

12:18.970 --> 12:19.810
How is he?

12:21.020 --> 12:22.310
The fire truck arrives.

12:22.310 --> 12:23.520
Someone's still in the theater?

12:23.520 --> 12:25.020
Hurry! Get inside and rescue them

12:27.220 --> 12:28.970
I was stunned from behind.

12:28.970 --> 12:30.970
Cheng Xiaoshi and Li Tianxi are missing.

12:30.970 --> 12:32.160
Must be taken away by them.

12:32.890 --> 12:34.810
But they may not have gone far.

12:34.810 --> 12:36.060
What a big commotion.

12:36.060 --> 12:38.140
It won't be easy for them to leave.

12:39.140 --> 12:41.020
The nearby blocks have been alarmed.

12:41.020 --> 12:43.720
All suspicious vehicles
and individuals will be checked.

12:44.220 --> 12:45.520
But

12:45.520 --> 12:48.140
why did they cause an explosion
to create trouble for themselves?

12:48.970 --> 12:51.270
Is there another way to escape?

12:52.390 --> 12:54.390
I remember when I was in
the underground warehouse

12:54.390 --> 12:56.470
I could hear the subway passing by clearly

12:57.350 --> 13:00.060
Could they escape through
an underground tunnel?

13:00.560 --> 13:02.060
That's possible.

13:05.180 --> 13:06.270
It's midnight now

13:06.270 --> 13:07.970
and the subway is not in operation

13:08.680 --> 13:09.600
The nearest should be

13:09.600 --> 13:10.720
Cao Hua Station

13:14.520 --> 13:15.720
In the warehouse

13:15.720 --> 13:17.770
I saw carton boxes from a
bakery at Cao Hua station.

13:20.100 --> 13:21.930
Yes, correct.

13:21.930 --> 13:23.970
But the subway tunnel has two
directions, north and south.

13:23.970 --> 13:25.720
We need to split up

13:27.930 --> 13:29.220
Alright

13:29.220 --> 13:31.810
Don't push yourselves if you are in danger

13:31.810 --> 13:33.180
OK.

13:36.970 --> 13:38.470
Why are you still standing there?

13:39.600 --> 13:42.270
Go back and stop her from
flirting with that guy.

13:44.520 --> 13:47.350
So you are the real murderer
who killed your wife.

13:47.350 --> 13:49.220
She didn't betray you.

13:50.140 --> 13:52.220
That man was also innocent.

13:52.220 --> 13:53.430
Bullshit

13:54.100 --> 13:56.470
I saw it and heard it.

13:56.470 --> 13:58.140
How can you allege they were innocent?

13:59.430 --> 14:01.520
He's the first person you asked me to kill

14:02.930 --> 14:04.430
How could I misremember?

14:05.310 --> 14:06.600
Don't forget

14:08.140 --> 14:09.970
when I controlled him,

14:11.850 --> 14:13.220
I could also peek into his memories

14:25.560 --> 14:29.520
He and your wife maintained
a pure colleague relationship.

14:30.220 --> 14:31.060
They rehearse

14:31.810 --> 14:32.600
eat meals

14:33.390 --> 14:34.720
chat

14:34.970 --> 14:35.350
and perform.

14:37.390 --> 14:38.430
That's all.

14:40.520 --> 14:42.680
The new play seems not good as well.

14:42.680 --> 14:45.640
If we let it go this way,
the small theater cannot survive either

14:46.640 --> 14:47.640
There's nothing we can do.

14:47.640 --> 14:49.600
Nowadays, young people are occupied

14:49.600 --> 14:51.430
by short videos and games.

14:51.430 --> 14:53.020
They don't have time
or money for stage plays

14:53.470 --> 14:55.310
Although there's subway noise here,

14:55.310 --> 14:57.140
the cost is still acceptable.

14:58.100 --> 15:00.520
By the way, are you free
the night after next?

15:00.520 --> 15:02.140
I found a new venue

15:02.140 --> 15:03.520
It might be even cheaper.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.890
The night after next

15:05.890 --> 15:07.560
Seriously, at night?

15:07.560 --> 15:08.810
I have an appointment

15:08.810 --> 15:10.560
You may go by yourself

15:10.560 --> 15:12.470
We're not the boss. No need to worry.

15:13.350 --> 15:15.430
There's a venue originally
designed for office use

15:15.430 --> 15:17.970
The area is a bit inadequate so
they advertised it for rent secretly

15:17.970 --> 15:20.770
We have to wait until the
factory area clears out.

15:20.770 --> 15:23.350
My husband is very opposed
to me coming home late

15:23.350 --> 15:25.020
Maybe it's just his job getting to him

15:25.020 --> 15:25.810
Excessive concern

15:27.350 --> 15:28.770
That's because he loves you.

15:32.140 --> 15:34.180
This space is not so well-shaped.

15:34.180 --> 15:35.970
That's why it can't be used as an office.

15:35.970 --> 15:37.890
But for artists like you,
it should be perfect.

15:37.890 --> 15:40.100
You can make it unique.

15:40.100 --> 15:41.140
Excuse me

15:41.140 --> 15:42.140
I have a call

15:45.020 --> 15:46.560
Hello, Qian Jin

15:46.560 --> 15:48.060
You're home already

15:48.060 --> 15:49.930
So early today.

15:51.140 --> 15:52.600
The case is finally closed.

15:52.600 --> 15:53.220
It's so late.

15:53.220 --> 15:54.310
Why are you still outside?

15:55.470 --> 15:57.720
I'm inspecting a venue for the troupe.

15:57.720 --> 15:59.930
Now? On your own?

16:01.850 --> 16:03.020
No, I'm not alone.

16:03.020 --> 16:04.390
Da Shuai is with me.

16:04.390 --> 16:05.310
Don't worry.

16:06.060 --> 16:06.890
Who's Da Shuai?

16:08.810 --> 16:11.100
My partner in the last play.

16:11.100 --> 16:12.020
Alright, alright.

16:12.020 --> 16:13.890
I'll introduce him to you later.

16:13.890 --> 16:14.680
Gotta hang up now.

16:17.470 --> 16:18.140
Done

16:18.140 --> 16:19.100
Let's continue.

16:27.770 --> 16:29.850
Everyday on the stage,

16:30.430 --> 16:31.350
they are so intimate

16:32.810 --> 16:34.970
Either in rehearsals or meals,

16:35.850 --> 16:36.810
they are always together

16:39.640 --> 16:40.560
How could they

16:41.680 --> 16:44.100
be innocent?

16:44.100 --> 16:45.390
I'm not wrong

16:45.390 --> 16:46.810
Based on my experience,

16:47.470 --> 16:49.180
I won't make mistakes in my investigation.

16:50.890 --> 16:52.680
They deserve to die

16:52.680 --> 16:54.310
They deserve to die

16:55.310 --> 16:57.430
Pah, what are you talking about?

17:00.560 --> 17:02.560
Who said I can't fit into it?

17:02.560 --> 17:05.100
Just a few pounds after I got married

17:05.100 --> 17:07.060
I can lose weight by eating less at night

17:12.930 --> 17:13.850
Then what about your child?

17:13.850 --> 17:15.140
Shut up!

17:15.140 --> 17:16.680
Don't mention this word

17:16.680 --> 17:19.060
You are not qualified to say this word

17:19.060 --> 17:20.310
You monster!

17:20.930 --> 17:22.220
All of you

17:22.220 --> 17:23.310
are damned monsters!

17:57.470 --> 17:58.600
Asshole

17:58.600 --> 18:00.600
You get a bulletproof vest for yourself

18:00.600 --> 18:03.060
and ask me to take risks all the time.

18:04.220 --> 18:05.470
You even wanna kill me

18:06.350 --> 18:07.520
I'm gonna kill you today

18:11.060 --> 18:12.310
Don't run away

18:12.310 --> 18:14.060
Aren't you always so arrogant?

18:15.350 --> 18:17.020
Let me show you

18:17.020 --> 18:19.220
how it feels to be a coward.

18:22.020 --> 18:23.270
Get the hell out of here

18:41.140 --> 18:42.810
You still wanna help him?

18:46.720 --> 18:49.430
If you are the one who
gave Lu Guang the photo

18:49.430 --> 18:51.180
it means that you desire our help.

18:51.180 --> 18:52.430
You're in no position to say that.

18:52.430 --> 18:53.850
I did seek your help

18:54.770 --> 18:57.020
but you ignored our cry just like others

18:57.810 --> 19:00.060
There is no change in the past.

19:01.220 --> 19:02.600
I know this because

19:03.770 --> 19:05.310
we're still in hell

19:06.390 --> 19:08.020
Cheng Xiaoshi

19:08.020 --> 19:09.220
Pick up the photo

19:09.640 --> 19:11.020
What I should do now

19:11.020 --> 19:12.220
is to save her, isn't it?

19:12.220 --> 19:14.020
If the photo is gone

19:14.020 --> 19:16.180
the "future', our present,
will no longer exist.

19:25.100 --> 19:26.640
After that day,

19:27.600 --> 19:29.560
I no longer have a future.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.100
I've decided

20:11.810 --> 20:13.770
to rewrite the destiny

20:32.060 --> 20:33.140
Lu Guang, watch out!

20:39.390 --> 20:40.270
Leave him alone

20:40.270 --> 20:42.810
Isn't he your most important friend?

20:42.810 --> 20:44.140
Don't you wanna save him?

20:44.970 --> 20:46.470
If I kill him now

20:46.470 --> 20:47.470
what will you do?

20:52.390 --> 20:53.970
Kill me now

20:55.720 --> 20:57.020
or

20:57.020 --> 20:59.270
go back to the past
and change everything?

21:03.680 --> 21:04.430
Tian Chen

21:06.310 --> 21:07.060
Tian Chen

21:12.220 --> 21:13.020
I

21:13.930 --> 21:14.720
I

21:15.560 --> 21:16.390
Wanna

21:18.430 --> 21:19.520
Go

21:20.810 --> 21:21.850
Home

21:34.930 --> 21:36.430
Like this.

21:36.430 --> 21:39.020
This means 'I' and 'want'.

21:41.520 --> 21:43.640
And this one means 'to return'

21:44.850 --> 21:46.770
Then bring your fingers of
both hands together like this.

21:47.020 --> 21:48.770
Raise them up like a roof,

21:49.100 --> 21:49.930
and it means 'home'
